    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Lab 11 - Observe an agent.** The spans of the lab, sent by `GrafanaExport.cs` when the lab runs with `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4317`. Run the lab, then refresh this page a few seconds after the end of the run. **Tokens** are summed over the `chat` spans, one per model call: an `invoke_agent` span repeats the tokens of its own model calls. **Click a trace ID** to open the trace: the weather agent runs inside the `execute_tool WeatherAgent` span of the travel assistant, and each `chat` span holds its HTTP request (`POST`)."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Agent runs",
      "description": "Number of invoke_agent spans: one per agent run (the weather agent called as a tool is a run too).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"lab11-observe-an-agent\" && span.gen_ai.operation.name=\"invoke_agent\"}",
          "tableType": "spans",
          "limit": 100,
          "spss": 100
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "count"
          ],
          "fields": "/^(duration|Duration)$/",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "purple"
